    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        69.16120147705078,
        447.8457336425781,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "In relation to the acceptability of moderate complexity automated NAATs:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        95.91809844970703,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        527.0581665039062,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "the automation of this class of technologies, which recognizes the high workload of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        322.1034240722656,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "laboratory staff, improves their acceptability;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        95.91809844970703,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        527.1807250976562,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "in terms of the physical size of the platform and how it fits into the laboratory space and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.981985092163086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        394.1229553222656,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "workflow, a smaller footprint may be more acceptable; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        95.91809844970703,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.9666748046875,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "the number of samples run on the system is acceptable provided that the platform is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        505.1285095214844,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "placed within a laboratory that receives a sufficient sample load to run the system.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        177.84820556640625,
        153.39910888671875,
        190.7292022705078
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.81922912597656,
        290.5672302246094,
        214.7332305908203
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention feasible to implement?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.66912841796875,
        78.81909942626953,
        238.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        225.66912841796875,
        527.0599365234375,
        238.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "The feasibility of all diagnostic technologies is challenged if there is an accumulation of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        241.16912841796875,
        526.744140625,
        254.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic delays or underuse (or both) at every step in the process, mainly because of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        256.66912841796875,
        229.56619262695312,
        269.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "health system factors such as:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        272.16912841796875,
        95.91809844970703,
        285.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        272.16912841796875,
        527.2120361328125,
        285.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "non-adherence to testing algorithms, testing for TB or MDR-TB late in the process,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        287.66912841796875,
        527.128173828125,
        300.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "empirical treatment, false negatives due to technology failure, large sample volumes and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.951493263244629,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        303.16912841796875,
        526.9644165039062,
        316.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "staff shortages, poor or delayed sample transport and sample quality, poor or delayed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        318.66912841796875,
        526.958984375,
        331.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "communication of results, delays in scheduling follow-up visits and recalling patients,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        334.1690979003906,
        284.91259765625,
        347.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "and inconsistent recording of results;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        349.6690979003906,
        95.91809844970703,
        362.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        349.6690979003906,
        526.9644165039062,
        362.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "lack of sufficient resources and maintenance (i.e. stock-outs; unreliable logistics; lack of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        365.1690979003906,
        526.9259643554688,
        378.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "funding, electricity, space, air conditioners and sputum containers; dusty environment;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        380.6690979003906,
        311.7192687988281,
        393.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "and delayed or absent local repair option);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        396.1690979003906,
        95.91809844970703,
        409.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        396.1690979003906,
        526.9628295898438,
        409.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "inefficient or unclear workflows and patient flows (e.g. inefficient organizational",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        411.6690979003906,
        527.1901245117188,
        424.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "processes, poor links between providers, and unclear follow-up mechanisms or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        427.1690979003906,
        338.583984375,
        440.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "information on where patients need to go); and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        442.6690979003906,
        95.91809844970703,
        455.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        442.6690979003906,
        441.04901123046875,
        455.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "lack of data-driven and inclusive national implementation processes.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        458.3561096191406,
        206.1001434326172,
        471.2370910644531
      ],
      "text": "QES: high confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        476.50372314453125,
        78.81909942626953,
        489.64874267578125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        476.50372314453125,
        471.37457275390625,
        489.64874267578125
      ],
      "text": "The feasibility of moderate complexity automated NAATs is also challenged by:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        492.00372314453125,
        95.91809844970703,
        505.14874267578125
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        492.00372314453125,
        526.9635009765625,
        505.14874267578125
      ],
      "text": "how or whether the platform fits into the physical space of the laboratory (considering",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        507.50372314453125,
        406.4831237792969,
        520.6487426757812
      ],
      "text": "bench size and weight of the platform) and sample workflow;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        523.0037231445312,
        95.91809844970703,
        536.1487426757812
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        523.0037231445312,
        518.0270385742188,
        536.1487426757812
      ],
      "text": "a poorly functioning sample transport system that affects the quality of samples; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        538.5037231445312,
        95.91809844970703,
        551.6487426757812
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        538.5037231445312,
        527.0493774414062,
        551.6487426757812
      ],
      "text": "the need to ensure that clinicians and laboratory staff have time to communicate",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        554.0037231445312,
        527.122314453125,
        567.1487426757812
      ],
      "text": "effectively regarding diagnostic results if the platform is centralized, while also ensuring",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.982736587524414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        569.5037231445312,
        527.0138549804688,
        582.6487426757812
      ],
      "text": "that the laboratory location is central enough to receive adequate numbers of samples",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        585.0037231445312,
        284.52777099609375,
        598.1487426757812
      ],
      "text": "to make the machine worth running.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        600.6907348632812,
        153.39910888671875,
        613.5717163085938
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.83837890625,
        78.81909942626953,
        631.9833984375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        618.83837890625,
        526.9630737304688,
        631.9833984375
      ],
      "text": "Implementation of new diagnostics must be accompanied by training for clinicians to help",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        634.33837890625,
        526.9861450195312,
        647.4833984375
      ],
      "text": "them interpret results from new molecular tests and understand how this information is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        649.83837890625,
        526.963134765625,
        662.9833984375
      ],
      "text": "translated into prompt and proper patient management. In the past, with the introduction",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        665.33837890625,
        300.53765869140625,
        678.4833984375
      ],
      "text": "of Xpert MTB/RIF, this has been a challenge.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        680.83837890625,
        260.7407531738281,
        693.9833984375
      ],
      "text": "and QES: high confidence   interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        696.33837890625,
        78.81909942626953,
        709.4833984375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        696.33837890625,
        526.986083984375,
        709.4833984375
      ],
      "text": "Introduction of new diagnostics must be accompanied by guidelines and algorithms that",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        711.83837890625,
        526.9202880859375,
        724.9833984375
      ],
      "text": "support clinicians and laboratories in communicating with each other, such that they can",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        727.33837890625,
        526.8302612304688,
        740.4833984375
      ],
      "text": "discuss discordant results and interpret laboratory results in the context of drug availability,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992998123168945,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        742.83837890625,
        395.5427551269531,
        755.9833984375
      ],
      "text": "patient history and patient progress on a current drug regimen.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        758.525390625,
        134.57229614257812,
        771.4063720703125
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 35",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
